{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01408",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.69,
      "end_seconds": 3.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.57,
      "end_seconds": 9.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.23,
      "end_seconds": 14.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "It's a hot swollen painful knee, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.92,
      "end_seconds": 17.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.8,
      "end_seconds": 20.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "About... well, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.09,
      "end_seconds": 32.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.31,
      "end_seconds": 40.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Mild, really. I'd say all the time. I notice it more with any movement."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.08,
      "end_seconds": 45.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Has there been fever and chills too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.88,
      "end_seconds": 48.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.62,
      "end_seconds": 52.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.15,
      "end_seconds": 57.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I'd say a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.47,
      "end_seconds": 62.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.11,
      "end_seconds": 65.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "I've got asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.21,
      "end_seconds": 66.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.72,
      "end_seconds": 71.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.84,
      "end_seconds": 82.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "Right, so acid reflux is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.15,
      "end_seconds": 97.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.09,
      "end_seconds": 107.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "I'm on Seretide inhaler, twice a day. I take something called lans... lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, maybe, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.11,
      "end_seconds": 114.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Okay, did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.07,
      "end_seconds": 119.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.98,
      "end_seconds": 122.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.74,
      "end_seconds": 126.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.24,
      "end_seconds": 130.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.84,
      "end_seconds": 135.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.49,
      "end_seconds": 138.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.46,
      "end_seconds": 146.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.02,
      "end_seconds": 149.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.71,
      "end_seconds": 154.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.22,
      "end_seconds": 157.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.53,
      "end_seconds": 166.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "So, I had a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.14,
      "end_seconds": 172.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.83,
      "end_seconds": 176.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.22,
      "end_seconds": 181.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Have you noticed other joint pain, rash or recent injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.81,
      "end_seconds": 186.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.82,
      "end_seconds": 190.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.77,
      "end_seconds": 195.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.91,
      "end_seconds": 201.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Right, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.13,
      "end_seconds": 208.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Well, no, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 224.1,
      "end_seconds": 230.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse 107, temp 39.2 degrees, pressure 110 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.96,
      "end_seconds": 232.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.58,
      "end_seconds": 239.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.55,
      "end_seconds": 242.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.39,
      "end_seconds": 267.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "The knee is hot, swollen and extremely painful when I move it even slightly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.61,
      "end_seconds": 273.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.04,
      "end_seconds": 285.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with possible septic arthritis at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.01,
      "end_seconds": 326.11,
      "duration_seconds": 22.1,
      "text": "I think a joint aspiration makes sense here, for hot swollen knee. I want urgent blood tests done, that's for septic arthritis. You need to go to hospital now for a joint washout assessment. The orthopaedic team would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.98,
      "end_seconds": 329.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.12,
      "end_seconds": 344.08,
      "duration_seconds": 12.96,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Let's review you straight away. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.07,
      "end_seconds": 347.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}